Package: com.gokuencinar.bandlock
Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Scan Test)
Version: 1.5.1~rhscan7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental RootHide signal analyzer with passive LTE band observation, strictly gated optional active scan and privacy-filtered RAT diagnostics. Passive observation never changes bands; active scan can interrupt cellular and emergency service.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/Gokuencinar/GokuEnREPO/blob/main/tweaks/BandLock/README.md
Depiction: https://gokuencinar.github.io/GokuEnREPO/tweaks/BandLock/depiction.html
Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Gokuencinar/GokuEnREPO/main/tweaks/BandLock/assets/icon.png
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<= 17.0)
Recommends: com.opa334.ccsupport
Conflicts: com.gokuencinar.bandlock.dopamine, com.gokuencinar.bandlock.rootful
